  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile data and scvi_n200 RNA encoder improve performance (config_030: 0.6315 accuracy). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder in the same setup, isolating the impact of image encoder choice. It addresses uncertainty about whether advanced image encoders (like ViT) further improve performance, while keeping other factors (aggregation, fusion, RNA encoder) constant. This comparison directly tests a key design decision with minimal parameter changes, maximizing information gain under budget constraints."
